*** Settings ***
Documentation    Dovecot features whose configuration is generated by the
...              module: shared seen flags, custom user quota and spam
...              retention dicts, mailbox name escaping, FTS, and the
...              local.conf.d snippet check.
Resource    ../api.resource
Library     SSHLibrary

*** Variables ***
${owner}     u1
${sharee}    u2
${quser}     u3

*** Test Cases ***
Share the owner INBOX with the sharee
    Dovecot    doveadm acl set -u ${owner} INBOX user=${sharee} lookup read write-seen

Seen flags are shared when sharedseen is enabled
    Set sharedseen    true
    ${subject} =    Save shared message    sharedseen-on
    Dovecot    doveadm flags add -u ${sharee} '\\Seen' mailbox Shared/${owner}/INBOX subject ${subject}
    Message is seen by    ${owner}     INBOX                      ${subject}
    Message is seen by    ${sharee}    Shared/${owner}/INBOX    ${subject}

Seen flags are private when sharedseen is disabled
    Set sharedseen    false
    ${subject} =    Save shared message    sharedseen-off
    Dovecot    doveadm flags add -u ${sharee} '\\Seen' mailbox Shared/${owner}/INBOX subject ${subject}
    Message is not seen by    ${owner}     INBOX                      ${subject}
    Message is seen by        ${sharee}    Shared/${owner}/INBOX    ${subject}

Restore sharedseen and the owner INBOX ACL
    Set sharedseen    true
    Dovecot    doveadm acl delete -u ${owner} INBOX user=${sharee}

User listing includes LDAP users
    ${out} =    Dovecot    doveadm user '*'
    Should Contain    ${out}    ${quser}

Custom user quota is applied by Dovecot
    Run task    module/${MID}/alter-user-mailbox    {"user":"${quser}","quota":{"limit":42}}
    ${out} =    Dovecot    doveadm -f tab quota get -u ${quser}
    Should Match Regexp    ${out}    STORAGE\\t\\d+\\t43008\\t

Default user quota is applied after the custom quota is removed
    Run task    module/${MID}/alter-user-mailbox    {"user":"${quser}","quota":{"custom":false}}
    ${out} =    Dovecot    doveadm -f tab quota get -u ${quser}
    Should Not Contain    ${out}    43008

Custom spam retention is stored in the uspamret dict
    Run task    module/${MID}/alter-user-mailbox    {"user":"${quser}","spam_retention":{"value":9,"custom":true}}
    ${out} =    Dovecot    doveadm dict get dict_server shared/spam_retention/${quser}
    Should Be Equal    ${out.strip()}    9

Custom spam retention is removed from the uspamret dict
    Run task    module/${MID}/alter-user-mailbox    {"user":"${quser}","spam_retention":{"custom":false}}
    Dovecot    doveadm dict get dict_server shared/spam_retention/${quser}    rc_expected=68

Mailbox names with dots are escaped on disk like Dovecot 2.3
    Dovecot    doveadm mailbox create -u ${quser} Dot.Test
    ${out} =    Dovecot    doveadm mailbox list -u ${quser}
    Should Contain    ${out}    Dot.Test
    Dovecot    test -d '/var/lib/vmail/${quser}/Maildir/.Dot\\2eTest'
    Dovecot    doveadm mailbox delete -u ${quser} Dot.Test

FTS uses the Danish default language
    ${out} =    Dovecot    doveadm fts tokenize -u ${quser} 'the house og huset'
    Should Contain    ${out}    the
    Should Not Contain    ${out}    og\n

FTS finds a delivered message
    ${word} =    Set Variable    zebrafoxtrot${quser}
    Execute Command    printf 'From: x@domain.test\\nSubject: fts\\n\\nhello ${word}\\n' | runagent -m ${MID} podman exec -i dovecot doveadm save -u ${quser}
    Dovecot    doveadm index -u ${quser} INBOX
    ${out} =    Dovecot    doveadm fts lookup -u ${quser} mailbox INBOX body ${word}
    Should Start With    ${out}    INBOX:

A valid snippet is applied
    Execute Command    printf 'mail_max_userip_connections = 21\\n' | runagent -m ${MID} podman exec -i dovecot sh -c 'cat > /etc/dovecot/local.conf.d/80-valid.conf'
    Execute Command    runagent -m ${MID} systemctl --user reload dovecot
    ${out} =    Dovecot    doveconf -h mail_max_userip_connections
    Should Be Equal    ${out.strip()}    21

All snippets are rejected if any is invalid
    Execute Command    printf 'plugin {\\n}\\n' | runagent -m ${MID} podman exec -i dovecot sh -c 'cat > /etc/dovecot/local.conf.d/90-invalid.conf'
    Execute Command    runagent -m ${MID} systemctl --user reload dovecot
    Dovecot    test ! -e /etc/dovecot/local.conf.d/80-valid.conf
    Dovecot    test ! -e /etc/dovecot/local.conf.d/90-invalid.conf
    ${out} =    Dovecot    ls -A /etc/dovecot/local.conf.d/
    ${match} =    Should Match Regexp    ${out}    \\.80-valid\\.conf\\.(\\d{14})\\.err
    Should Contain    ${out}    .90-invalid.conf.${match}[1].err
    ${status} =    Execute Command    runagent -m ${MID} systemctl --user is-active dovecot
    Should Be Equal    ${status}    active

The rejection is counted by facts
    ${facts} =    Run task    module/${MID}/get-facts    ""
    Should Be True    ${facts}[dovecot_custom_config_rejected_count] >= 1

Clean up the rejected snippets
    Dovecot    sh -c 'rm -f /etc/dovecot/local.conf.d/.80-valid.conf.*.err /etc/dovecot/local.conf.d/.90-invalid.conf.*.err'

*** Keywords ***
Dovecot
    [Arguments]    ${command}    ${rc_expected}=0
    [Documentation]    Run a command in the dovecot container
    ${out}  ${err}  ${rc} =    Execute Command
    ...    runagent -m ${MID} podman exec dovecot ${command}
    ...    return_rc=True    return_stderr=True
    Should Be Equal As Integers    ${rc}    ${rc_expected}    ${command} failed:${\n}${err}
    RETURN    ${out}

Set sharedseen
    [Arguments]    ${enabled}
    Run task    module/${MID}/set-mailbox-settings    {"sharedseen":{"enabled":${enabled}}}
    Wait Until Keyword Succeeds    20 seconds    1 second
    ...    Shared namespace private index is    ${enabled}

Shared namespace private index is
    [Arguments]    ${sharedseen}
    ${out} =    Dovecot    grep -c 'mail_index_private_path = ~/Maildir/shared/' /etc/dovecot/dovecot.conf    rc_expected=${{ 1 if '${sharedseen}' == 'true' else 0 }}
    Should Be Equal    ${out.strip()}    ${{ '0' if '${sharedseen}' == 'true' else '1' }}

Save shared message
    [Arguments]    ${prefix}
    ${subject} =    Evaluate    '${prefix}-' + str(__import__('time').time_ns())
    Execute Command    printf 'From: x@domain.test\\nSubject: ${subject}\\n\\nbody\\n' | runagent -m ${MID} podman exec -i dovecot doveadm save -u ${owner}
    RETURN    ${subject}

Message is seen by
    [Arguments]    ${user}    ${mailbox}    ${subject}
    ${out} =    Dovecot    doveadm search -u ${user} mailbox ${mailbox} subject ${subject} seen
    Should Not Be Empty    ${out}

Message is not seen by
    [Arguments]    ${user}    ${mailbox}    ${subject}
    ${out} =    Dovecot    doveadm search -u ${user} mailbox ${mailbox} subject ${subject} seen
    Should Be Empty    ${out}
